{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_1","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"孝元之世，亡王子侯者，盛衰終始，豈非命哉！元始之際，王莽擅朝，偽褒宗室，侯及王之孫焉；〔一〕居攝而愈多，非其正，故弗錄。〔二〕旋踵亦絕，悲夫！","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_2","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「王之孫亦得封侯，謂承鄉侯閟以下是也。」","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_3","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"〔二〕　師古曰：「王莽所封，故不以為正也。」","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_4","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"王子侯表第三下","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_5","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"校勘記","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_6","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"四八三頁　二欄　五格，錢大昭說「（暂缺）」不成字，閩本作「（暂缺E61A）」。　按殿本作「緁」。　注「于」，殿本作「千」。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_7","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"四八七頁　二欄　三格「十」，景祐、殿本都作「七」。　朱一新說作「七」是。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_8","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"四八七頁　三欄　三格「二」，景祐、殿本都作「三」。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_9","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"四八七頁　三欄　三格「二」，景祐、殿本都作「三」。　王先謙說作「三」是。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_10","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"四八八頁　一欄　三格，錢大昭說「乙」當作「己」，下修故侯亦誤。　按殿本都作「己」。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_11","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"四八九頁　二欄　三格「三」，景祐、殿本都作「二」。　蘇輿說作「二」是。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_12","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"四九０頁　四欄　三格「四年」，景祐、殿、局本都作「四月」。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_13","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"四九二頁　一欄　一格「平」，景祐本作「年」，殿本脫。　注「力」，景祐、殿本都作「方」。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_14","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"四九三頁　一欄　三格，蘇輿說「二年」當作「三年」。　按景祐本作「三年」","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_15","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"四九四頁　七欄　一格「王」，殿本作「壬」。　王先謙說作「壬」是。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_16","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"四九五頁　二欄　三格「二月」，景祐、殿本都作「三月」。　朱一新說作「三月」是。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_17","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"四九六頁　四欄　五格「固」，景祐、殿本都作「國」。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_18","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"四九八頁　七欄　四格「免」，景祐、殿、局本都作「嗣」。　朱一新說作「嗣」是。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_19","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"四九九頁　二欄　五格「欽」，錢大昭說閩本作「褒」，朱一新說注本作「褒」。　按景祐、殿本都作「煬」。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_20","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"五一一頁　一欄　四格，朱一新說注本「免」作「薨」。　按景祐、殿本都作「薨」。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_21","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"五二０頁　四欄　三格「免」，據景祐、殿、局本補。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_22","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"五二一頁　二欄　一格「成」，景祐、殿本都作「城」。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_17_23","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_17","textTraditional":"五二三頁　一欄　一格，錢大昭說「連」不成字，汪本作「疌」。　按景祐、殿本都作「疌」。","sentenceOrder":23}],"overrides":{}}